keywords":["Devoid"],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"not_legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"not_legal","pioneer":"legal","predh":"not_legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","tlr":"not_legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{4}{R}","name":"Turn Against","oracle_id":"634d6357-af76-4e25-8c63-81522bc726f5","oracle_text":"Devoid (This card has no color.)\nGain control of target creature until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2015-10-02","toughness":null,"type_line":"Instant"},{"cmc":1.0,"color_identity":["U"],"colors":["U"],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"legal","brawl":"legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"legal","paupercommander":"legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"legal","standard":"legal","standardbrawl":"legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{U}","name":"Unsummon","oracle_id":"837182db-1bf3-4a2c-bd01-1af9d9873561","oracle_text":"Return target creature to its owner's hand.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2026-04-24","toughness":null,"type_line":"Instant"}],"fixture_kind":"public_exact-list_card_data","rulings":[{"comment":"A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.","oracle_id":"634d6357-af76-4e25-8c63-81522bc726f5","published_at":"2015-08-25","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.","oracle_id":"634d6357-af76-4e25-8c63-81522bc726f5","published_at":"2015-08-25","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.","oracle_id":"634d6357-af76-4e25-8c63-81522bc726f5","published_at":"2015-08-25","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Gaining control of a creature doesn’t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it.","oracle_id":"634d6357-af76-4e25-8c63-81522bc726f5","published_at":"2015-08-25","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.","oracle_id":"634d6357-af76-4e25-8c63-81522bc726f5","published_at":"2015-08-25","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.","oracle_id":"634d6357-af76-4e25-8c63-81522bc726f5","published_at":"2015-08-25","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Turn Against can target any creature, even one that’s untapped or one you already control.","oracle_id":"634d6357-af76-4e25-8c63-81522bc726f5","published_at":"2015-08-25","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If there are fewer than twenty cards in the targeted player's library, that player puts all the cards from their library into their graveyard.","oracle_id":"cc2b6e58-2d6f-495e-95f3-9496105c4cba","published_at":"2009-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Riddlekeeper doesn’t impose a cost to attack. Creatures can attack you or a planeswalker you control even if their controller has no cards left in their library.","oracle_id":"df23a4a5-eddd-4b0e-9f7e-a3733ce49c0d","published_at":"2011-09-22","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
